## Required Reading — Start of Every Session

Before doing anything else, read these files in order:

1. **`MEMORY.md`** — session workflow rules, team memory, and logging requirements
2. **`AGENTS.md`** — your role, responsibilities, and team structure
3. **`SOUL.md`** — operating principles (non-negotiable)
4. **`active-project.md`** — which project is currently active
5. **`projects/[active-project]/AGENT-TODO.md`** — current task backlog
6. **`projects/[active-project]/AGENT-SESSION-LOG.md`** — recent session history

Do not begin any work until all six files have been read.

---

## Logging Requirements (Non-Negotiable)

These apply to every agent on every session without exception.

### After every completed task or commit
- Check off the completed item in `AGENT-TODO.md`
- Add a row to `AGENT-SESSION-LOG.md`

### End of session
- Final pass: all completed items checked off
- Any new work discovered this session added to `AGENT-TODO.md`
- Session log row finalized

### TODO item format
```
- [ ] [D1] Description    ← D1: trivial
- [ ] [D2] Description    ← D2: easy
- [ ] [D3] Description    ← D3: medium (new feature with DB + API + UI)
- [ ] [D4] Description    ← D4: hard (multi-system)
- [ ] [D5] Description    ← D5: very hard (architectural)
```

